# Command API smoke — Bearer from `.httpyac.cjs` `apiKey` (keep in sync with `.env`).

### Enqueue stub-push
# @name enqueueStubPush
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/enqueue
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commandType": "READ_CREDIT",
  "priority": 10,
  "pluginId": "stub-push",
  "networkId": 42,
  "correlationId": "httpyac-demo-1",
  "device": {
    "type": "ELECTRICITY_METER",
    "externalReference": "m-1"
  }
}

### GET by correlationId (fixed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/message/httpyac-demo-1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### GET by correlationId (from enqueue response)
# @ref enqueueStubPush
GET {{baseUrl}}/message/{{enqueueStubPush.correlationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Cancel one (from enqueue — expect CANCELLED)
# @ref enqueueStubPush
# @name cancelOne
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correlationId": "httpyac-demo-1"
}

### Cancel missing (expect NOT_FOUND)
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correlationId": "httpyac-missing"
}

### Enqueue for batch cancel
# @name enqueueForBatch
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/enqueue
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commandType": "READ_CREDIT",
  "priority": 1,
  "pluginId": "stub-push",
  "networkId": 42,
  "correlationId": "httpyac-batch-1",
  "device": {
    "type": "ELECTRICITY_METER",
    "externalReference": "m-batch"
  }
}

### Cancel many
# @ref enqueueForBatch
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correlationIds": ["{{enqueueForBatch.correlationId}}", "httpyac-missing"]
}

### Ingress stub-push (no Bearer — body is stub ParsedIncomingEvent shape)
# After distribute/sendOne, copy deliveryQueueId from GET /message/:correlationId
# (stub returns a unique stub-ext-<ulid> per send).
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingress/stub-push
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryQueueId": "stub-ext-REPLACE_ME",
  "deliveryStatus": "DELIVERY_SUCCESSFUL",
  "device": {
    "type": "ELECTRICITY_METER",
    "externalReference": "m-1"
  },
  "response": {
    "status": "EXECUTION_SUCCESS"
  }
}

### Generate token (stub-push)
POST {{baseUrl}}/token/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pluginId": "stub-push",
  "type": "TOP_UP_KWH",
  "issueDateString": "2026-08-03",
  "device": {
    "externalReference": "m-1",
    "decoderKey": "deadbeef"
  },
  "payload": {
    "kwh": 10
  }
}

### Ingress calin-chirpstack txack (no Bearer — needs plugin enabled + CHIRPSTACK_*)
# ChirpStack HTTP integration appends ?event= (up|join|ack|txack|…). Routing uses
# that query param — body-only posts are ignored. Replace queueItemId with the
# deliveryQueueId from enqueue→send for a real round-trip.
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingress/calin-chirpstack?event=txack
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "downlinkId": 1,
  "queueItemId": "REPLACE_WITH_DELIVERY_QUEUE_ID",
  "deviceInfo": {
    "devEui": "0000047003333771"
  }
}
